     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p><span><a href=\"https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/rro/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/rro/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241783206000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1jym57rrOjqieM0KhMaqP8\">Revolution R Open</a></span><span> 3.2.2, the enhanced open source R distribution from Revolution Analytics and Microsoft, is now <a href=\"https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/download/#download\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/download/%23download&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241783206000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1b_YG2YmXw_aML4lyPjyJ_\"><span>available for download</span></a>. This update brings <a href=\"https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/rro/multithread/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/rro/multithread/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241783206000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DvH8Pv9AJS_03kjOVc43N\"><span>multi-threaded performance</span></a> to the latest update to the R engine from the <a href=\"https://www.r-project.org/contributors.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.r-project.org/contributors.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241783206000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2fn5l3FMk6OE2j1OqurHg4\"><span>R Core Group</span></a>, which includes <a href=\"https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/news/#r322\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/news/%23r322&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241783206000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2m7pSQ-dS7axhmbGZHro7x\"><span>several improvements and bug fixes</span></a>. Significant amongst these is default support for HTTPS connections, making it easy to follow the <a href=\"http://blog.revolutionanalytics.com/2015/08/good-advice-for-security-with-r.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://blog.revolutionanalytics.com/2015/08/good-advice-for-security-with-r.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241783206000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2j_iBhNXJDZd0Sy07zRAlt\"><span>best practices for R security</span></a> recommended by the R Consortium. The <a href=\"https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/rro/reproducibility/#timemachine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/rro/reproducibility/%23timemachine&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241783206000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xKnuJ79AvWjNdcIwUniAp\"><span>checkpoint package</span></a> included with Revolution R Open likewise uses HTTPS when downloading R package versions for reproducible data analysis.</span></p>\r\n<p><span></span><br></p>\r\n<p><span>RRO 3.2.2 is available for download now for <a href=\"https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/rro/installation/#sysreq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/rro/installation/%23sysreq&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241783206000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Huvqm-pGl7HAjFcz9BzIg\"><span>Windows, Mac and Linux systems</span></a>, and is <a href=\"https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/rro/#compatible\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/rro/%23compatible&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241783206000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1eXQgvaeiZsp2DLXG0faGh\"><span>100% compatible</span></a> with R 3.2.2.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><br></span></p><p><span>You can download Revolution R Open now from the link below, and we welcome comments, suggestions and other discussion on the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/rropen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!forum/rropen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241783206000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1DzAeEfJPKFh-OJELzNHT4\"><span>RRO Google Group</span></a>. If you&#39;re new to Revolution R Open, here are some <a href=\"http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/getting-started/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/getting-started/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241783206000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3WGNuM3wG4jRWlGexTPniC\"><span>tips to get started</span></a>, and there are many <a href=\"https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/data/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/data/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241783206000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2MgGGqXUJXC-73iT4gYGVr\"><span>data sources you can explore with RRO</span></a>. Thanks go as always to the <a href=\"https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/what-is-r/#contributors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/what-is-r/%23contributors&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241783206000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0yscDGfluOLMNGGSa0s-oD\"><span>contributors to the R Project</span></a> upon which RRO is built.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><br></span></p><p><span>MRAN: <a href=\"https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/download/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/download/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241783206000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1eBqvjfxGaXh4f6x3tm0_p\"><span>Download Revolution R Open</span></a></span></p></div>"
